<title>BELARUS: Belarus producer prices rise 3.9 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Belarus producer prices rise 3.9 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus's producer prices rose 3.9 percent in August after a rise of 2.5 percent in July, bringing the year-on-year increase to 33 percent, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    BELARUS PRODUCER PRICES    Aug 96    July 96    Aug 95</p>
<p>    mth/mth			   +3.9	+2.5	  +5.2</p>
<p>    yr/yr			    +33	 +34	  +595.2</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264</p>
